


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_69f6cf20:



    voice "2HI_0440"
    hina "「咦？开着？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_9b2d73b3:


    "将钥匙插进广播室门里的阳菜露出了不可思议的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_11876caf:



    voice "2FU_0405B"
    fumi "「是老师忘了关吗？啊，里面好像有人」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_5be1864f:



    voice "2RI_0474"
    rin "「那到底是不是人呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_d3ed0975:



    voice "2HI_0441"
    hina "「别～说～了～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_7ccd7516:



    voice "2MI_0310"
    miyako "「进去看看吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_68942062:


    "结果，房间里的并不是幽灵。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_4b68e474:



    voice "2SA_0174"
    sachiko "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_5d35e5be:



    voice "2HI_0442"
    hina "「祥子姐？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_a_6b4bda72:


    "祥子将手上拿着的蓝色封皮的册子放回柜子里，带着疑惑的表情走了过来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_g_402f85ce:


    "祥子将手上拿着的广播部的部志放回柜子里，带着疑惑的表情走了过来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_g_76f7a359:



    voice "2MI_0311"
    miyako "「……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_a263ec34:



    voice "2SA_0175"
    sachiko "「咦，你们是来干什么的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_65832ea6:



    voice "2HI_0443"
    hina "「我们是来还这个的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_f411834b:


    "阳菜把手里捧着的麦克风举了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_18fc1cd0:



    voice "2RI_0475"
    rin "「话说，我们才应该问你是来干什么的吧。祥子姐你为什么会在这里？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_e0dc123d:



    voice "2SA_0176"
    sachiko "「打工。我有时候会来打扫」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_157d924e:



    voice "2HI_0444"
    hina "「校务员？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_7feba120:



    voice "2FU_0406"
    fumi "「但是，之前都没见过啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_cab2d050:



    voice "2SA_0177"
    sachiko "「都是在上课或者休息的时候做的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_252ad9ab:



    voice "2RI_0476"
    rin "「……不打工，就过不下去了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_ba41673a:



    voice "2SA_0178"
    sachiko "「是啊，宿管工资很低的……我最后一次吃饭都是三天前了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_f2bce814:



    voice "2FU_0407"
    fumi "「昨天晚上，你不是拿了比萨吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_c6a2d461:



    voice "2SA_0179"
    sachiko "「是吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_383231d7:



    voice "2HI_0445"
    hina "「没钱的话，少抽点烟不就行了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_b558fcb5:



    voice "2SA_0180"
    sachiko "「你是想让我去死吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_9c40fd5e:



    voice "2RI_0477"
    rin "「太夸张了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_7ebb4cd3:



    voice "2SA_0181"
    sachiko "「其实我在攒钱打造一个只有可爱女孩子的乐园。当然你们也包含在内」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_11d4fd74:



    voice "2HI_0446"
    hina "「做梦！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_0abd3833:



    voice "2MI_0312"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_65fee00f:


    "在四个人聊天的同时，圣夜子毫无阻碍地向着房间内部走去。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_20cd669d:



    voice "2SA_0182"
    sachiko "「喂，你要去哪里？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_806f1aae:


    "祥子伸手拦住她。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_1b8b82fc:



    voice "2MI_0313"
    miyako "「我还以为里面有人」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_2a83a6c0:



    voice "2SA_0183"
    sachiko "「没人了，只有我一个」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_b7b51abc:



    voice "2MI_0314"
    miyako "「是吗，我觉得有人在——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_469feb4b:


    "说着，圣夜子把视线转向头顶的方向……"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_404a3440:



    voice "2HI_0447"
    hina "「啊啊啊！！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_9459ae33:


    "从圣夜子的视线里察觉到了什么，阳菜发出了惨叫。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_d7f434d4:



    voice "2RI_0478"
    rin "「能察觉到幽灵的吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_4df41777:



    voice "2MI_0315"
    miyako "「那个……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_6d056c0c:



    voice "2SA_0184"
    sachiko "「你妨碍到我扫地了快点出来吧。那边我来打扫」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_baa17409:


    "说着，祥子从阳菜手上接过麦克风。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_7e723f5e:



    voice "2HI_0448"
    hina "「各位，早点回去吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_4fef5e92:



    voice "2RI_0479"
    rin "「为了究明真相，我们——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_b3a99fe2:



    voice "2HI_0449"
    hina "「不用探明也行」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_a7112aa7:



    voice "2FU_0408"
    fumi "「好了好了，要没时间去买东西了哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_a918568b:


    "文察觉到祥子的想法，催促二人。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_64e5d8e3:



    voice "2SA_0185"
    sachiko "「那么再见了。我会负责锁门的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_be07912f:



    voice "2FU_0409"
    fumi "「失陪了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_96784900:


    "文推着阳菜和伦的后背，走出了房间。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_0392ec5e:



    voice "2MI_0316"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_9aff8f13:


    "圣夜子还在打量房间。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_9dbd6173:



    voice "2FU_0410"
    fumi "「圣夜子？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_fe320dfd:



    voice "2MI_0317"
    miyako "「好，我现在就走」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_9d6c35da:


    "向祥子低了低头，圣夜子也追着那三人走了出去。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_bf30b4b4:


    "四人走了之后，广播室里再次安静了下来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_f4a6d190:


    "祥子抬头看了看圣夜子刚才盯着的地方。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_af3c4d8c:



    voice "2SA_0186"
    sachiko "「……没有呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_62182a66:


    "祥子小声叹了口气，将阳菜拿来的麦克风放回到了柜子里。"




translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_3404bc77:


    voice "2FU_0406"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_03_c_2ab36d1f:


    fumi "「但是，之前都没见过啊」"
